{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48833","headline":"庐山瀑布 · 张碧","name":"庐山瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁将织女机头练，贴出青山碧云面。\n造化工夫不等闲，剪破澄江凝一片。\n怪来洞口流呜咽，怕见三冬昼飞雪。\n石镜无光相对愁，漫漫顶上沈秋月。\n争得阳乌照山北，放出青天豁胸臆。\n黛花新染插天风，蓦吐中心烂银色。\n五月六月暑云飞，阁门远看澄心机。\n参差碎碧落岩畔，梅花乱摆当风散。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张碧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}